%% MEDIS — Sequence Diagram 1: Login Process
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Actor
    participant LoginFrame
    participant LoginController
    participant UserDAO
    participant Database
    participant DashboardFrame

    Actor->>LoginFrame: enter username/password, click Login
    LoginFrame->>LoginController: authenticate(user, pass)
    LoginController->>LoginController: Validator.isNotBlank(user, pass)
    LoginController->>UserDAO: findByUsername(user)
    UserDAO->>Database: SELECT ... LEFT JOIN doctors
    Database-->>UserDAO: row(s)
    Note over UserDAO: instantiate Admin / Doctor / Receptionist by role
    UserDAO-->>LoginController: Optional[User]
    LoginController->>LoginController: PasswordHasher.verify(pass, hash)

    alt user found AND password matches
        LoginController-->>LoginFrame: Result.ok(user)
        LoginFrame->>DashboardFrame: setCurrentUser(user); open
    else blank / invalid credentials
        LoginController-->>LoginFrame: Result.fail(msg)
        LoginFrame->>LoginFrame: DialogHelper.showError(msg)
    end
